[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Over the South Pole]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.69]How was the plane able to clear the mountains? | 飞机是怎样飞越群山的？
[00:15.88]In 1929, three years after his flight over the North Pole, | 1929年，也就是他飞越北极3年之后，
[00:22.78]the American explorer, R.E. Byrd, | 美国探险家 R.E. 伯德
[00:27.04]successfully flew over the South Pole for the first time. | 成功地第一次飞越了南极。
[00:32.03]Though, at first, Byrd and his men were able to take a | 虽然开始时伯德和他的助手们拍下了
[00:37.06]great many photographs of the mountains that lay below, | 飞机下面连绵群山的许多照片，
[00:42.09]they soon ran into serious trouble. | 但他们很快就陷入了困境。
[00:46.01]At one point, it seemed certain that their plane would crash. | 在有个地方，飞机似乎肯定要坠毁了。
[00:51.39]It could only get over the mountains if it rose to 10, 000 feet. | 只有在飞至10,000英尺的高度时，它才能越过这些群山。
[00:57.71]Byrd at once ordered his men to throw out two heavy food sacks. | 伯德马上命令助手们把两个沉重的食物袋扔掉。
[01:04.15]The plane was then able to rise and it cleared the mountains by 400 feet. | 于是飞机可以上升了，它在离山头400英尺的高度飞越了群山。
[01:11.03]Byrd now knew that he would be able to reach the South Pole which was 300 miles away, | 伯德这时知道他能够到达300英里以外的南极了，
[01:18.78]for there were no more mountains in sight. | 因为前面再没有山了。
[01:22.53]The aircraft was able to fly over the endless white plains without difficulty. | 飞机可以毫无困难地飞越这片茫茫无际的白色原野。
